s. Set model_catalog.enabled=false in config.yaml to prevent automatic conversion of `:` to `/` in model names.\", \".hermes directory is a git repo. Before modifying .hermes files, check if tracked with `git ls-files`. If not tracked and config-related, add to repo first. Commit changes after successful modifications.\", \"TUI model override persistence: The `_sync_agent_model_with_config()` function (tui_gateway/server.py:5757) is called on every prompt submit. It checks for `session.model_override` and returns early if present. If missing, ...","status":"ok","task_id":"c127d78a-a34d-429c-b1c0-845063851951","tool_call_id":"call_4a3425b6f6a342c4bed54c95","tool_name":"memory","turn_id":"20260616_224315_5a0468:c127d78a-a34d-429c-b1c0-845063851951:60a54a45"},"sessionId":"20260616_224315_5a0468","timestamp":"2026-06-17T04:01:17.451024+00:00"},"type":"raw"}}␀␀’è␀␀ìÅÿÿ